  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5008.03 Exceptions.\n\n(a) All display fireworks shall be kept in storage magazines unless they are:\n\n(1) In process of manufacture;\n\n(2) Being used; or\n\n(3) Being transported.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; amd by #7481, eff 4-25-0101; paragraphs (a)(1)-(3) EXPIRED 7-1-03; amd by #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04; paragraphs (a)(1)-(3) EXPIRED: 1-10-05; amd by #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
